Engineering — systems, design, construction, and operation (@engineering-map: 0, is #chapter, #engineering "mining-and-mineral-engineering/Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA", #engineering "../materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1", #engineering "../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618", #engineering "../materials/chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems/Chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems.lingua#r_05V6FYWMN0VND552CQE94HHA2Q", #engineering "../physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W", #engineering "electrical-power-engineering/Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ", #engineering "mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R", #engineering "materials-engineering/Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9") { r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68
Connect physical principles, measured materials, design alternatives, construction, operation, maintenance, and evidence. A useful design must fit its conditions, supporting services, people, and continuing work.

Begin with [Mining and mineral engineering — extraction, processing, and continuing work](mining-and-mineral-engineering/Mining-and-mineral-engineering.lingua#r_22HJPS3RTK5EX1J55YJP75PHYA) for resource evidence, extraction methods, mine planning, ground, excavation/transport, utilities, mineral processing, products, waste, closure, and independent investigation.

Shared foundations are available through [Inquiry — shared ways to understand and investigate](../inquiry/Inquiry.lingua#r_75MNKZQKNB0XBG021SWWW2HASB), [Ergon — useful labor and productive knowledge](../../Ergon.lingua#r_FE78A5A2D2A3261F711703DCC1), [Earth — materials, processes, and geological history](../../gaia/earth/Earth.lingua#r_5H7Y6QD1FW4Z0JJ6C7SH4DDHXH), and [General chemistry](../chemistry/general-chemistry/General-chemistry.lingua#r_206GS6CVXD8WSY1VX7PRF7136V). Follow connected production and upkeep through [Hephaestus](../Hephaestus.lingua#r_00000000000000000000002001); questions about evidence, purposes, and assumptions return to [Philosophy](../../../scholazein/philosophy/Philosophy.lingua#r_00000000000000000000001001).

Connect extraction/refining, evolving material structure, fabrication, inspection, and continuing work through [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../materials/metals-and-metallurgical-production/Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1).

Connect chemical transformations and product evidence with reaction/separation systems, utilities, scale and operation through [Industrial chemistry — chemical transformations, useful products and continuing production](../chemistry/industrial-chemistry/Industrial-chemistry.lingua#r_3AKBAFB2ABJ0671QW6ZBQ0B618).

Investigate specified chemical materials, supplier and delivery interfaces, qualified inventories, continuity and recovery through [Chemical feedstocks and supply systems — specified materials from origin to accepted use](../materials/chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems/Chemical-feedstocks-and-supply-systems.lingua#r_05V6FYWMN0VND552CQE94HHA2Q).

Connect electrical, magnetic, wave and material models with their physical evidence through [Physics — fields, matter, motion and physical evidence](../physics/Physics.lingua#r_04A5CP8RTBERZEN4XCCDQ3T47W).

Develop electrical sources, networks, machines, conversion, protection, stability, construction and continuing service through [Electrical power engineering — sources, networks, machines and continuing service](electrical-power-engineering/Electrical-power-engineering.lingua#r_300EPNGATK7PHWNZCQFBXGZFCQ).

**Thermodynamics and heat transfer:** [Thermodynamics and heat transfer](../physics/thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer/Thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer.lingua#r_6KQBZNJM6WNV9A69R3DZY1NH7E) develops energy, entropy, equilibrium, transport, measurements and advanced thermal investigation through complete books, courses and shared foundations.

**Fluid dynamics:** [Fluid dynamics — motion, forces, transport and evidence](../physics/fluid-dynamics/Fluid-dynamics.lingua#r_7PQW1WDHK708BFV23MD8ET61VZ) connects observed fluid motion with pressure, forces, conservation laws, transport and the mathematical and experimental evidence for a flow model.

**Water and sanitation:** [Water, sanitation and industrial utilities — from sources to continuing service](../utilities/water-and-sanitation/Water-sanitation-and-industrial-utilities.lingua#r_7B9GRCJFHVBEEQEXKWCR2QMMPN) follows water sources, quality, delivery, treatment, recovery and the work required to maintain service.

**Mechanical engineering:** [Mechanical engineering and machine design — useful mechanisms and continuing service](mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design/Mechanical-engineering-and-machine-design.lingua#r_0017YZ63HZBZ4P4WD8DECVWE4R) begins with machine functions, quantities and drawings, then develops statics and dynamics through vibration, rotating machinery and advanced analytical studies. Material and structural studies now continue through strength, damage and numerical/experimental evidence. Machine-element studies continue through mechanisms, transmissions, bearings, joints and actuators. Detailed manufacture, metrology, assembly, commissioning, repair and recovery lead into a worked measuring-carriage account, three further advanced investigations and independent research.

[Development scope: Engineering](../../../lince/Trails.lingua#r_15X36BC9BQB5PV6WW77ZAAJP48).

**Materials engineering:** [Materials engineering — structure, processing and useful behavior](materials-engineering/Materials-engineering.lingua#r_05BF5JM8141RKF1VT5998YFZQ9) begins with material functions, quantities, state/history, bonding, structure and measurement. Equilibrium and kinetics lead into material-family studies and mechanical response: elasticity, viscoelasticity, plasticity, fracture, fatigue and creep. Functional properties connect quantum/statistical foundations with charge, heat, polarization, light and magnetism. Fabrication and state control connect process balances and scale with shaping, cure, consolidation, joining, coatings and thin-film integration. Degradation and environment connect corrosion, oxidation, polymer and mineral-material deterioration, wood decay and wear with accelerated-test criticism and service evidence. Selection connects property evidence and derived indices with constraints, tradeoffs and qualification. Service, repair and recovery lead into functional equivalence, life-cycle accounting and material stocks. Multiscale models, measurement inference, atomistic work, phase-field verification and materials informatics lead into integrated process-to-service investigations. Twenty-four sustained studies, seven original numerical programs and independent research with defense and revision connect derivations with primary evidence.

} r_5DA6VY09MAD2N8D9SH0FFJVV68

